Replicate golden files generated against the OpenAI-compatible surface
(https://api.replicate.com/v1).

These inputs are NOT generated by running LiteLLM (see plan §14). They
encode the documented OpenAI-compatible wire format Replicate exposes.
Divergences from LiteLLM's Python transforms are intentional where
LiteLLM is known to be buggy; the provider's official docs are
authoritative.
